<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Hub Power rises 1.87 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Hub Power rises 1.87 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's blue-chip Hub Power jumped 0.65 rupees, or 1.87 percent, to 35.45 on Monday after its Global Depositary Receipt (GDR) rates rose in the international market, dealers said.</p>
<p>A turnover of 2.08 million shares of Hub Power was recorded in the morning session.</p>
<p>&quot;Hub Power is leading sentiment today after its GDR rates gained abroad,&quot; dealer Shakil Anwar said. &quot;The stock is attractive to foreign investors due to its guaranteed high returns.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
